1
00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:15,920
Come in.

2
00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:18,760
Chairman,

3
00:00:19,040 --> 00:00:21,560
the seized goods are
in the East Suburb Warehouse.

4
00:00:21,560 --> 00:00:22,360
The manager's name is Bai.

5
00:00:22,360 --> 00:00:24,020
We've already contacted him.

6
00:00:40,040 --> 00:00:40,800
Feng Shu,

7
00:00:42,760 --> 00:00:44,520
if I remember correctly,

8
00:00:46,120 --> 00:00:47,480
Dacheng Group

9
00:00:48,480 --> 00:00:50,720
shares a warehouse with us, right?

10
00:00:52,520 --> 00:00:53,160
But

11
00:00:53,360 --> 00:00:56,200
the relevant inbound and outbound
paperwork must be prepared in advance.

12
00:00:56,200 --> 00:00:57,260
Most importantly,

13
00:00:57,480 --> 00:00:58,040
this

14
00:00:58,360 --> 00:00:59,560
needs to be done fast.

15
00:01:01,800 --> 00:01:02,600
Right now,

16
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:05,400
we can only try to find a way
from this angle.

17
00:01:06,600 --> 00:01:07,680
Hurry up and

18
00:01:08,480 --> 00:01:10,410
get the relevant documents ready.

19
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:14,200
When can I meet

20
00:01:14,400 --> 00:01:15,760
this manager named Bai?

21
00:01:16,640 --> 00:01:17,770
That's the problem.

22
00:01:18,160 --> 00:01:18,920
He said

23
00:01:19,320 --> 00:01:21,360
he'll report the facts to the police

24
00:01:21,600 --> 00:01:23,530
and there's no need to meet anyone.

25
00:01:24,120 --> 00:01:25,560
Bullshit.

26
00:01:26,840 --> 00:01:27,840
If he wants money, give it to him.

27
00:01:27,840 --> 00:01:29,370
Give him whatever he wants.

28
00:01:29,960 --> 00:01:31,039
From what I heard,

29
00:01:31,600 --> 00:01:32,800
it's not about money.

30
00:01:35,200 --> 00:01:37,000
Do you have

31
00:01:38,520 --> 00:01:39,650
this Bai's profile?

32
00:01:42,720 --> 00:01:43,960
Name, Bai Jiuzhou.

33
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:45,039
Gender, male.

34
00:01:45,280 --> 00:01:46,320
Age, 42.

35
00:01:46,320 --> 00:01:47,120
Address,

36
00:01:47,400 --> 00:01:50,200
Village Two Relocation Housing, Old
Factory District, West Suburb of Checheng.

37
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:51,200
Family members.

38
00:01:51,200 --> 00:01:52,240
Wife, Zhao Wenjuan,

39
00:01:52,240 --> 00:01:54,360
39, cashier at Dahua Company.

40
00:01:54,600 --> 00:01:55,720
Son, Bai Xiaosi,

41
00:01:55,720 --> 00:01:57,650
nine, elementary school student.

42
00:01:57,720 --> 00:01:59,200
Bai Jiuzhou's employment status.

43
00:01:59,200 --> 00:02:00,660
Position, West Suburb...

44
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:06,080
Feng Shu,

45
00:02:09,199 --> 00:02:11,160
everyone has a soft spot, right?

46
00:02:13,880 --> 00:02:14,600
Go.

47
00:02:17,760 --> 00:02:18,600
Understood.

48
00:02:25,320 --> 00:02:27,920
All right, I'll be there soon.

49
00:02:29,040 --> 00:02:29,680
Bye.

50
00:02:30,480 --> 00:02:31,160
Bye.

51
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:39,640
Hey,

52
00:02:39,880 --> 00:02:41,210
do you know how to drive?

53
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:43,760
Kid,

54
00:02:44,200 --> 00:02:45,120
are you okay?

55
00:02:47,040 --> 00:02:48,720
It's all my driver's fault
for being blind.

56
00:02:48,720 --> 00:02:49,720
I'm really sorry.

57
00:02:50,120 --> 00:02:51,600
It's fine. You can go.

58
00:02:51,600 --> 00:02:52,800
An apology is enough.

59
00:02:53,560 --> 00:02:55,160
I'm really sorry about that.

60
00:02:56,400 --> 00:02:57,000
By the way,

61
00:02:57,280 --> 00:02:58,940
do you like playing with toys?

62
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:00,480
Toys? What toys?

63
00:03:01,080 --> 00:03:02,800
I have a lot of toys in my car.

64
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:04,520
I can give it to you as compensation.

65
00:03:04,520 --> 00:03:05,360
Why don't you go take a look?

66
00:03:05,360 --> 00:03:06,760
Really? I can have it all?

67
00:03:06,800 --> 00:03:08,000
Of course. Let's go.

68
00:03:19,280 --> 00:03:20,079
It is reported that

69
00:03:20,079 --> 00:03:22,200
Song Yucheng, chairman of Dacheng Group,

70
00:03:22,200 --> 00:03:24,040
disguised this batch
of cannabinoid materials

71
00:03:24,040 --> 00:03:26,320
as the company's common
industrial raw materials

72
00:03:26,320 --> 00:03:28,520
and stored them
in the western suburb warehouse.

73
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:30,280
Since the warehouse
is shared by Dacheng Group

74
00:03:30,280 --> 00:03:32,040
and Wending Group,

75
00:03:32,040 --> 00:03:32,680
relevant departments

76
00:03:32,680 --> 00:03:34,240
once suspected

77
00:03:34,240 --> 00:03:36,560
Wending Group of drug manufacturing.

78
00:03:36,840 --> 00:03:39,079
Eventually,
a warehouse manager surnamed Bai

79
00:03:39,079 --> 00:03:42,040
provided the police
with an entry and exit log,

80
00:03:42,079 --> 00:03:43,880
proving that all the contraband

81
00:03:43,880 --> 00:03:45,880
belonged to Dacheng Group.

82
00:03:46,160 --> 00:03:46,820
Therefore,

83
00:03:46,880 --> 00:03:48,640
the police opened an investigation

84
00:03:48,640 --> 00:03:51,000
into Dacheng Group three months ago.

85
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:52,560
And half a month ago,

86
00:03:52,560 --> 00:03:54,320
the coercive measure against Song Yucheng,
chairman of Dacheng Group,

87
00:03:54,320 --> 00:03:55,800
was changed from criminal detention

88
00:03:55,800 --> 00:03:58,920
to residential surveillance.

89
00:03:59,200 --> 00:04:02,040
The surveillance location
is right behind me at Dacheng Group.

90
00:04:02,040 --> 00:04:03,170
But just last night,

91
00:04:03,240 --> 00:04:05,520
while the guarding officer
was pouring water,

92
00:04:05,520 --> 00:04:07,000
Song Yucheng broke through
the glass window

93
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:09,530
and committed suicide
to escape punishment.

94
00:04:15,040 --> 00:04:16,000
Bai Jiuzhou,

95
00:04:16,519 --> 00:04:17,519
you did a good job.

96
00:04:19,640 --> 00:04:20,320
Mr. Gao,

97
00:04:21,279 --> 00:04:22,720
I really didn't expect

98
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:24,320
this

99
00:04:25,040 --> 00:04:26,440
to drive him to his death.

100
00:04:27,280 --> 00:04:28,880
I've really committed a sin.

101
00:04:36,120 --> 00:04:36,920
He just

102
00:04:37,280 --> 00:04:38,880
wasn't cut out for business.

103
00:04:42,920 --> 00:04:45,120
He couldn't handle the pressure at all.

104
00:04:45,240 --> 00:04:47,120
But I must congratulate you.

105
00:04:47,120 --> 00:04:48,280
From now on,

106
00:04:48,760 --> 00:04:50,480
we'll have to call you Mr. Bai.

107
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:52,800
Mr. Bai!

108
00:04:55,880 --> 00:04:57,040
Our company

109
00:04:57,040 --> 00:04:59,000
has a branch in the western suburbs.

110
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:01,120
As long as you keep your mouth shut,

111
00:05:01,880 --> 00:05:04,160
the position of general manager there

112
00:05:04,920 --> 00:05:05,680
is yours.

113
00:05:07,640 --> 00:05:08,720
Forget it, Mr. Gao.

114
00:05:10,320 --> 00:05:12,850
I'd rather go back
to being an administrator.

115
00:05:13,280 --> 00:05:14,600
I've never done anything

116
00:05:14,600 --> 00:05:16,460
against my conscience in my life.

117
00:05:16,880 --> 00:05:17,640
If

118
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:19,930
I became a manager at your company,

119
00:05:21,280 --> 00:05:23,280
I wouldn't be able to sleep at night.

120
00:05:37,080 --> 00:05:37,810
Fair enough.

121
00:05:39,040 --> 00:05:39,770
I'll give you

122
00:05:40,159 --> 00:05:41,520
a sum of money.

123
00:05:42,080 --> 00:05:44,200
It's too crowded
for three generations of your family

124
00:05:44,200 --> 00:05:45,520
under one roof.

125
00:05:46,920 --> 00:05:48,120
Forget it, Mr. Gao.

126
00:05:49,600 --> 00:05:51,680
If I get a big house because of this,

127
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:54,600
I'll have nightmares living in it.

128
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:56,800
Mr. Gao,

129
00:05:57,320 --> 00:05:58,650
let's just be strangers

130
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:00,280
from now on.

131
00:06:00,880 --> 00:06:02,280
If there's nothing else,

132
00:06:03,040 --> 00:06:03,900
I'll get going.

133
00:06:11,320 --> 00:06:12,120
Mr. Gao,

134
00:06:13,520 --> 00:06:15,120
I have one last request.

135
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:19,360
My wife and kids

136
00:06:20,240 --> 00:06:21,200
are my life.

137
00:06:21,720 --> 00:06:23,650
Don't you dare lay a finger on them.

138
00:06:24,200 --> 00:06:25,040
After this,

139
00:06:25,680 --> 00:06:27,040
we're even.

140
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:52,720
Fengshu,

141
00:06:54,520 --> 00:06:56,840
Bai Jiuzhou won't listen to reason.

142
00:06:59,880 --> 00:07:02,280
The sky is covered with dark clouds.

143
00:07:03,440 --> 00:07:04,840
I guess

144
00:07:05,680 --> 00:07:07,680
there'll be a fierce storm tonight.

145
00:07:08,320 --> 00:07:09,600
When it rains,

146
00:07:09,840 --> 00:07:11,640
drivers and pedestrians

147
00:07:12,240 --> 00:07:13,800
all need to be careful.

148
00:07:30,120 --> 00:07:30,920
Hey,

149
00:07:31,560 --> 00:07:32,200
honey.

150
00:07:32,240 --> 00:07:33,500
Are you done with work?

151
00:07:34,120 --> 00:07:35,450
Alright, let's go home.

152
00:07:55,080 --> 00:07:55,840
Captain Li,

153
00:07:56,480 --> 00:07:58,159
these two

154
00:07:59,240 --> 00:08:01,640
are really soulmates.

155
00:08:02,480 --> 00:08:03,880
But then again,

156
00:08:04,200 --> 00:08:06,600
your childhood friend is quite something.

157
00:08:06,880 --> 00:08:08,120
In just a few months,

158
00:08:08,120 --> 00:08:10,400
I've met all his girlfriends.

159
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:11,840
First love,

160
00:08:12,400 --> 00:08:13,330
ex-girlfriend,

161
00:08:13,440 --> 00:08:14,640
current girlfriend.

162
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:15,640
Oh boy,

163
00:08:16,080 --> 00:08:17,280
one after another.

164
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:21,600
Let's be serious.

165
00:08:22,280 --> 00:08:24,140
Based on all the evidence we have,

166
00:08:25,120 --> 00:08:26,880
do you think it's enough?

167
00:08:29,200 --> 00:08:30,960
Well,

168
00:08:31,360 --> 00:08:32,400
it is enough.

169
00:08:32,880 --> 00:08:33,720
But

170
00:08:35,200 --> 00:08:36,080
I just have this

171
00:08:36,080 --> 00:08:37,610
indescribable feeling...

172
00:08:38,720 --> 00:08:41,120
If it's indescribable,
it means it's not enough.

173
00:08:41,120 --> 00:08:41,880
No.

174
00:08:42,200 --> 00:08:43,039
It means

175
00:08:43,039 --> 00:08:45,640
you still have doubts in your mind.

176
00:08:46,280 --> 00:08:47,480
Think about it again.

177
00:08:50,880 --> 00:08:52,200
Call Captain Weng.

178
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:56,240
Wei,

179
00:08:57,920 --> 00:09:00,650
did you find anything
watching Shen Xi's people?

180
00:09:00,840 --> 00:09:01,880
Nothing at all.

181
00:09:02,680 --> 00:09:03,800
Shen Xi

182
00:09:04,160 --> 00:09:06,200
hasn't stepped out of the house at all.

183
00:09:06,200 --> 00:09:07,930
She must be in a really bad mood.

184
00:09:08,440 --> 00:09:09,280
What about you?

185
00:09:09,280 --> 00:09:11,200
Did you get anything
from talking to your buddy?

186
00:09:11,200 --> 00:09:12,400
Nothing at all.

187
00:09:14,520 --> 00:09:16,280
But tomorrow,

188
00:09:16,280 --> 00:09:17,240
the boss

189
00:09:17,240 --> 00:09:19,160
is going to push us
to close the case again.

190
00:09:19,160 --> 00:09:20,360
In my opinion,

191
00:09:20,360 --> 00:09:21,420
we're almost done.

192
00:09:21,680 --> 00:09:24,340
We can hold out until
the end of this week at most.

193
00:09:24,640 --> 00:09:25,200
I'm hanging up.

194
00:09:25,200 --> 00:09:26,800
Call me if anything comes up.

195
00:09:27,040 --> 00:09:27,570
Alright.

196
00:09:28,480 --> 00:09:29,040
Bye.

197
00:09:32,040 --> 00:09:33,080
Then let's

198
00:09:33,160 --> 00:09:34,360
go home, Captain Li.

199
00:09:42,760 --> 00:09:43,280
Hello,

200
00:09:43,960 --> 00:09:44,600
Shen Xi.

201
00:09:44,760 --> 00:09:45,420
Captain Li,

202
00:09:46,480 --> 00:09:47,400
are you busy?

203
00:09:47,720 --> 00:09:48,240
What's wrong?

204
00:09:48,240 --> 00:09:49,500
Did something happen?

205
00:09:49,840 --> 00:09:50,480
No.

206
00:09:51,280 --> 00:09:52,610
I just finished dancing

207
00:09:52,720 --> 00:09:53,780
and I'm a bit tired.

208
00:09:54,920 --> 00:09:57,120
You went to see Song Yanfei, didn't you?

209
00:09:57,240 --> 00:09:57,880
Why?

210
00:09:58,200 --> 00:09:59,080
Thank you,

211
00:09:59,920 --> 00:10:00,580
Captain Li.

212
00:10:01,080 --> 00:10:02,640
Thank me for what?

213
00:10:02,880 --> 00:10:04,040
Thank you

214
00:10:05,040 --> 00:10:06,570
for clearing the air for us.

215
00:10:07,720 --> 00:10:08,840
Yayan

216
00:10:09,200 --> 00:10:10,640
just called me.

217
00:10:10,960 --> 00:10:12,160
It's good to clear the air.

218
00:10:12,160 --> 00:10:14,090
You guys are still friends, right?

219
00:10:15,840 --> 00:10:17,040
She also invited me

220
00:10:17,840 --> 00:10:20,400
to dance the lead role
in the dance drama again.

221
00:10:20,400 --> 00:10:21,360
She said

222
00:10:22,160 --> 00:10:24,520
this role belonged to me
in the first place.

223
00:10:24,520 --> 00:10:25,200
That's great news.

224
00:10:25,200 --> 00:10:26,200
Did you say yes?

225
00:10:27,160 --> 00:10:28,000
I did.

226
00:10:29,040 --> 00:10:30,160
This Saturday

227
00:10:30,720 --> 00:10:32,050
at the Cultural Palace.

228
00:10:32,720 --> 00:10:34,120
I'd like to invite you

229
00:10:34,520 --> 00:10:36,560
and Officer Jiang.

230
00:10:37,520 --> 00:10:39,520
I've already saved tickets for you.

231
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:41,040
Can you come?

232
00:10:42,400 --> 00:10:43,860
I'll definitely be there.

233
00:11:19,560 --> 00:11:20,640
Look who's here.

234
00:11:21,280 --> 00:11:22,080
Yayan.

235
00:11:22,720 --> 00:11:23,380
Captain Li.

236
00:11:23,560 --> 00:11:25,000
Hope I'm not interrupting.

237
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:25,840
Not at all.

238
00:11:26,840 --> 00:11:27,700
This is for you.

239
00:11:28,160 --> 00:11:28,960
Thank you.

240
00:11:29,240 --> 00:11:30,240
Congratulations.

241
00:11:30,240 --> 00:11:32,640
You're finally the official lead actress.

242
00:11:33,240 --> 00:11:34,500
Thank you, Captain Li.

243
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:36,730
Captain Li is single right now.

244
00:11:38,800 --> 00:11:41,060
Actually, we went on a blind date before.

245
00:11:41,480 --> 00:11:42,640
But

246
00:11:43,880 --> 00:11:45,080
it wasn't meant to be.

247
00:11:45,360 --> 00:11:46,280
Captain Li,

248
00:11:46,400 --> 00:11:48,530
you've been on quite a few blind dates.

249
00:11:48,760 --> 00:11:49,560
Not really.

250
00:11:50,560 --> 00:11:51,760
You two are both here.

251
00:11:52,680 --> 00:11:54,480
This is so awkward. Unbelievable.

252
00:11:54,480 --> 00:11:55,520
I'd better head to the audience.

253
00:11:55,520 --> 00:11:56,160
See you.

254
00:11:59,040 --> 00:11:59,760
Captain Li!

255
00:12:00,720 --> 00:12:02,450
Once I finish this dance today,

256
00:12:03,680 --> 00:12:05,040
it'll all be over.

257
00:12:05,840 --> 00:12:07,080
Over?

258
00:12:07,360 --> 00:12:08,960
We still have so many tour dates ahead.

259
00:12:08,960 --> 00:12:09,800
I'm not dancing anymore.

260
00:12:09,800 --> 00:12:11,530
I'm handing over the lead role.

261
00:12:13,560 --> 00:12:14,360
It's fine.

262
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:16,120
See you at the show.

263
00:12:16,520 --> 00:12:17,180
Captain Li!

264
00:12:19,960 --> 00:12:20,560
Good luck.

265
00:12:23,200 --> 00:12:24,000
Yayan,

266
00:12:24,640 --> 00:12:26,000
I have a gift for you.

267
00:12:26,080 --> 00:12:27,080
For me?

268
00:12:34,080 --> 00:12:35,440
I hope you like it.

269
00:12:36,440 --> 00:12:37,760
This music box

270
00:12:38,600 --> 00:12:40,480
means a lot to me.

271
00:12:41,240 --> 00:12:42,680
Now I'm giving it to you.

272
00:12:44,880 --> 00:12:45,800
I believe

273
00:12:45,920 --> 00:12:47,780
everything happens for a reason.

274
00:12:49,480 --> 00:12:50,440
Thank you.

275
00:12:52,640 --> 00:12:54,280
I will treasure it.

276
00:12:56,960 --> 00:12:57,520
Come,

277
00:12:57,920 --> 00:12:59,720
sit. Let me touch up your makeup.

278
00:13:03,880 --> 00:13:05,520
Look at our leading lady.

279
00:13:06,120 --> 00:13:06,960
So beautiful.

280
00:13:07,640 --> 00:13:08,680
It's a pity

281
00:13:08,680 --> 00:13:10,120
I have things to do
at the greenhouse today,

282
00:13:10,120 --> 00:13:12,050
so I can't watch from the audience.

283
00:13:12,080 --> 00:13:14,400
But I believe it will be perfect.

284
00:13:15,840 --> 00:13:18,280
We'll celebrate your success
when you get back tonight.

285
00:13:18,280 --> 00:13:19,080
Okay.

286
00:13:21,760 --> 00:13:22,690
See you tonight.

287
00:15:29,880 --> 00:15:30,200
Li Xingchen: Yu Xiaotong

288
00:15:30,200 --> 00:15:30,480
Song Yanfei: Wang Zhiyong (Wang Ruizi)

289
00:15:30,480 --> 00:15:31,160
Shen Xi: Xie Tiantian

290
00:15:31,160 --> 00:15:31,480
Yan Yongmei: Fang Ming (Fang Xingyi)

291
00:15:31,480 --> 00:15:31,760
Feng Shu: Liu Yakun

